  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Sago Starch Utilization in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to food diversification and food security in Sulawesi island of Indonesia, through capacity building designed to improve the production, utilization and marketing of sago starch and its downstream processed products as alternative carbohydrates sources.</narrative>
